      Create a file named <code>sctp-server.yaml</code> that defines a pod with the following YAML:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nmetadata:\n  name: sctpserver\n  labels:\n    app: sctpserver\nspec:\n  containers:\n    - name: sctpserver\n      image: registry.access.redhat.com/ubi9/ubi\n      command: [\"/bin/sh\", \"-c\"]\n      args:\n        [\"dnf install -y nc && sleep inf\"]\n      ports:\n        - containerPort: 30102\n          name: sctpserver\n          protocol: SCTP"} lang="yaml" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Create the pod by entering the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc create -f sctp-server.yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      </ol>
      </li>
      <li>
      Create a service for the SCTP listener pod.
      <ol>
      <li>
      Create a file named <code>sctp-service.yaml</code> that defines a service with the following YAML:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: sctpservice\n  labels:\n    app: sctpserver\nspec:\n  type: NodePort\n  selector:\n    app: sctpserver\n  ports:\n    - name: sctpserver\n      protocol: SCTP\n      port: 30102\n      targetPort: 30102"} lang="yaml" />
      </li>
      <li>
      To create the service, enter the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc create -f sctp-service.yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      </ol>
      </li>
      <li>
      Create a pod for the SCTP client.
      <ol>
      <li>
      Create a file named <code>sctp-client.yaml</code> with the following YAML:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: Pod\nmetadata:\n  name: sctpclient\n  labels:\n    app: sctpclient\nspec:\n  containers:\n    - name: sctpclient\n      image: registry.access.redhat.com/ubi9/ubi\n      command: [\"/bin/sh\", \"-c\"]\n      args:\n        [\"dnf install -y nc && sleep inf\"]"} lang="yaml" />
      </li>
      <li>
      To create the <code>Pod</code> object, enter the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc apply -f sctp-client.yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      </ol>
      </li>
      <li>
      Run an SCTP listener on the server.
      <ol>
